OL,3,ATwo workers pulled alive from Nepal
OL,4,Atunnel nine days after deadly flash
OL,5,Aflooding
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people have been rescued from a
OL,8,Fhydropower tunnel in Nepal nine days
OL,9,Fafter a devastating flash flood at the
OL,10,FNepal-China border, rescuers tell the
OL,11,FBBC
OL,13,FEmergency workers cheered as they
OL,14,Flifted Sanjaya Shah and Kabir Maharjan
OL,15,Fto safety - watch the dramatic moment
OL,16,Fthey were freed
OL,18,FAt least 39 others are expected to be
OL,19,Frescued from the tunnel after rescuers
OL,20,Fheard voices early on Friday,
OL,21,Fauthorities told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
